### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Get All Properties
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties

### Get Property by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/1

### Create New Property
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "123 Main Street",
  "city": "New York",
  "state": "NY",
  "zipCode": "10001",
  "price": 500000,
  "bedrooms": 3,
  "bathrooms": 2,
  "squareFeet": 2500
}

### Update Property
PUT {{baseUrl}}/properties/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 550000,
  "bedrooms": 4
}

### Delete Property
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/properties/1

### Get AI Price Prediction
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/predict-price
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "456 Oak Avenue",
  "city": "San Francisco",
  "state": "CA",
  "squareFeet": 3000,
  "bedrooms": 3,
  "bathrooms": 2
}

### Get AI Property Recommendations
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/recommendations?maxPrice=600000&minBedrooms=2
